\]
with low set \(\mathcal L=\{\ell_1,\ldots,\ell_r\}\), useful segment capacities \(B_0=N_0+\mathbf 1_{\{M\ge1\}}\), \(B_i=N_i+1\) for \(1\le i\le r-1\), and segment/low maxima \(m_{i,j}=\max_{q=i+1,\ldots,j}\ell_q\), reports propose the reduced LP
\[
