./logs/iter_014_idea_02_explorer_01.stderr.log:2640:Assume the learner is path-aware/horizon-oblivious and may choose at time \(t\) an actual quote distribution whose payoff against every \(c\in C_t\) is at least \(c-\delta(C_t)-\varepsilon_t\), where \(\sum_{t<T}\varepsilon_t=o(T)\). Then for every horizon,
