./logs/iter_006_idea_01_explorer_01_critic_01.stderr.log:1103:The deterministic policy that posts \(a_{T,\varepsilon}\) every round has pseudo-regret at most \(\varepsilon\). This uses the problem's \(\sup_a\mathbb E-\mathbb E\) regret, law and horizon awareness, and no computability constraint. Status: accepted.
